{"root":"ken","ipa":"/kɛn/","core":"指代某种特定的、通常是负面的或令人不快的经历、遭遇或感受，常用于口语中表示“被……击中”、“遭受”、“中招”。","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/kɛn/","zh":"遭受，中招，被击中（口语）","phrases":[{"t":"ken tipu","zh":"被骗"},{"t":"ken marah","zh":"被骂"},{"t":"ken tilang","zh":"被开罚单"}],"examples":[{"t":"Saya ken tipu oleh orang asing itu.","zh":"我被那个陌生人骗了。"},{"t":"Dia ken marah karena datang terlambat.","zh":"他因为迟到被骂了。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"ken","ipa":"/kɛn/","zh":"遭受，中招","phrase":{"t":"ken batuk","zh":"患上咳嗽"},"example":{"t":"Hati-hati, nanti kamu ken flu.","zh":"小心，待会儿你会得流感。"}},{"w":"kena","ipa":"/kəna/","zh":"击中，触及，遭受（正式形式）","phrase":{"t":"kena sasaran","zh":"击中目标"},"example":{"t":"Tembakannya tepat kena sasaran.","zh":"他的射击精准地击中了目标。"}},{"w":"mengenai","ipa":"/məŋənai/","zh":"关于，涉及，击中","phrase":{"t":"mengenai masalah ini","zh":"关于这个问题"},"example":{"t":"Dia berbicara mengenai rencana masa depan.","zh":"他谈论了关于未来的计划。"}},{"w":"mengenakan","ipa":"/məŋənakan/","zh":"穿戴，施加（罚款、税收等）","phrase":{"t":"mengenakan pakaian","zh":"穿衣服"},"example":{"t":"Pemerintah mengenakan pajak baru.","zh":"政府征收了新税。"}},{"w":"terkena","ipa":"/tərkəna/","zh":"被击中，中招，遭受（被动）","phrase":{"t":"terkena dampak","zh":"受到影响"},"example":{"t":"Banyak rumah terkena banjir.","zh":"许多房屋遭受了洪水灾害。"}}],"derSlugs":["ken","kena","mengenai","mengenakan","terkena"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T01:29:33.583Z","src":"base"}